<title>UK: Austin Reed sales up 7 pct in first 4 months.</title>
<headline>Austin Reed sales up 7 pct in first 4 months.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retailer Austin Reed Group Plc said on Thursday that its like-for-like sales rose seven percent in the first four months of its financial year.  </p>
<p>&quot;Trading has continued reasonably well for the first four months of the current year,&quot; chairman Colin Evans told shareholders at the company's annual meeting.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
